{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03001","headline":"江上遇疾风 · 张九龄","name":"江上遇疾风","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"疾风江上起，鼓怒扬烟埃。\n白昼晦如夕，洪涛声若雷。\n投林鸟铩羽，入浦鱼曝鳃。\n瓦飞屋且发，帆快樯已摧。\n不知天地气，何爲此喧豗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}